Description: NVIDIA legacy 470.256.02 driver metapackage (Kepler (GeForce 600/700 series))
 The 470.256.02 driver from the NVIDIA 470xx legacy series, repackaged as a
 reproducible build for trixie.
 .
 Supported hardware: Kepler (GeForce 600/700 series).
 .
 UPSTREAM STATUS: Upstream EOL 2024-Q3. Community-patched for newer kernels (see joanbm).

