 nvidia-legacy-470xx-kernel-support (= ${binary:Version}),
Provides: xorg-driver-video
Description: NVIDIA legacy 470.256.02 driver — Xorg driver
 The nvidia_drv.so X.Org video driver from the 470.256.02 release.
 Officially targets X server video driver ABI <= 25.


Package: nvidia-legacy-470xx-driver-libs
Architecture: amd64 i386
Multi-Arch: same
Section: non-free/libs
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends},
 libgl1, libglx0, libegl1, libgbm1,
Provides:
 nvidia-legacy-470xx-driver-libs-nonglvnd,
 libgl1-nvidia-glx,
 libgl1-nvidia-legacy-470xx-glx,
 vdpau-driver,
 libglx-nvidia,
Description: NVIDIA legacy 470.256.02 driver — runtime libraries
 Every shared library from the NVIDIA 470.256.02 userspace: libGL / libGLX_nvidia
 / libEGL_nvidia, libnvidia-glcore, libnvidia-tls, libnvidia-eglcore,
 libnvidia-ml, libcuda and friends, plus the GLX X extension module. Install the
 :i386 variant alongside for 32-bit applications.

Package: nvidia-legacy-470xx-kernel-support
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: NVIDIA legacy 470.256.02 driver — kernel/X integration glue
 Ships the nouveau blacklist, the modprobe alias, the initramfs hook, the udev
 rules and the /etc/X11/xorg.conf.d snippet for the 470.256.02 driver.

Package: nvidia-legacy-470xx-kernel-6.12.0-rt-amd64
Architecture: amd64
Section: non-free/kernel
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, linux-image-6.12.0-rt-amd64
Provides: nvidia-legacy-470xx-kernel-6.12.0-rt-amd64,
 nvidia-legacy-470xx-kernel-modules
Description: NVIDIA legacy 470xx prebuilt module for Linux 6.12.0-rt-amd64
 The nvidia/-modeset/-drm/-uvm modules from the 470xx series,
 compiled for the 6.12.0-rt-amd64 kernel ABI. No toolchain needed on the target.
